msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Open Addon Settings"
msgstr "打开插件设置"

#: quicksnap.py:20
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "QuickSnap Tool"
msgstr "QuickSnap 工具"

#: quicksnap.py:22
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Quickly snap selection from/to a selected vertex, curve point, object origin, edge midpoint, face center.\nUse the same keymap to open the tool PIE menu."
msgstr "快速将所选内容吸附到/从选定的顶点、曲线点、物体原点、边中点、面中心。\n使用相同快捷键打开该工具的饼菜单。"
